    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to Coconut! </strong>\ud83c\udf34\u2728 Dive into the ultimate coconut-clicking frenzy where the fun never stops. Ready to get your click on?<br><br><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong><br><strong>Click, Click, Click:</strong> It's simple. Click coconuts. Get points. Repeat. The more you click, the more coconuts you conquer! \ud83c\udf4d\ud83d\udcaa<br><br><strong>Epic Skin Drops:</strong> Why settle for basic coconuts when you can have EPIC coconuts? Collect wild and wacky skins every 2 hours, and if you\u2019re really lucky, score those ultra-rare skins every 14 hours. \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f\ud83c\udf52 (These skins as of now will only be available in your Steam Inventory, not in-game)<br><br><br><strong>Thematic Madness:</strong> Switch up your coconut game with insane themes. From tropical vibes to spooky nights, your coconuts will never look the same again. \ud83c\udf1e\ud83c\udf83<br><br><strong>Fresh Content:</strong> We\u2019re always cooking up something new. Stay tuned for frequent updates packed with more skins, themes, and coconut chaos. \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf6a",
